BT 1 0 0 1 0 31.8 Tm 13.8 TL /F2 9.6 Tf .12549 .12549 .12549 rg (One-line judgement:) Tj /F1 9.6 Tf ( For live commerce, the bottleneck was never content \227 it was the cost and availability) Tj T* (of a human anchor. The winning product was not a more lifelike avatar, but an unmanned, script-driven live) Tj T* (room that a non-technical merchant could set up and trust to run 24/7.) Tj T* ET
